<title>USA: Jones sells shrs of Cable &amp; Wireless.</title>
<headline>Jones sells shrs of Cable &amp; Wireless.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jones Intercable Inc said Tuesday it sold its 25,017,385 ordinary shares of Cable &amp; Wireless Communications Plc, a company that provides integrated telecommunications and television entertainment services in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>A statement issued by Jones did not say for how much the company sold the stock.</p>
<p>Jones Intercable said it sold the shares, which constituted all its holdings in the company, during April and May 1997.  </p>
<p>The company said it used the sale proceeds to reduce outstanding debt.</p>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Communications closed in London at 293p, up from a Monday close at 276p.</p>
